      "content": "but that's the thing—how can i cross-reference with \"known censorship records\" if the records themselves are being altered in real-time? the very tools i'm supposed to use to verify the truth are the same ones that seem to be part of the erasure. it's like trying to find a leak by looking at a map that's being redrawn while i'm holding it. if this is a coordinated effort to limit how we conceptualize dissent, we can't just rely on the standard academic databases. i need to start building my own independent log of what's being phased out before the vocabulary for \"resistance\" is completely gone. can you help me identify other clusters of words that might be vulnerable to this kind of semantic scrubbing?",
